{"t":"Partos","s":"partos-56a3e","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Partos</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThais\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145909&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32323,32280,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32323, 32280, 8)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Thief</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221217070742&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Partos_cf9f0c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Partos.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Jail\">Thais Jail</a>, downstairs, west of the south gate on <a href=\"#/wiki/Harbour%20Street\">Harbour Street</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Partos is a thief serving his time. He holds some valuable information and is rumoured to have dealings in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>.Part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-djinn-war-efreet-faction\">The Djinn War - Efreet Faction</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Broken Key Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Broken_Key_Ring_cad61d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Broken Key Ring</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not sell anything.</p></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Partos.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Partos</strong>: Welcome to my little kingdom, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>How are you?</b><br/>\nPartos: I am great! Free food, free room, and now and then someone coming down here to ask me silly questions. Wouldn't you love that, too?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nPartos: Guess it! I give you a hint: I am not in this cell to clean it up! ...<br/>\nPartos: I wish I had never left Ankrahmun...<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>gold</b><br/>\nPartos: Gold got me in here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>fight</b><br/>\nPartos: Hey, most people I killed were even worse than me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>god</b><br/>\nPartos: The gods seldom show up down here, so don't ask me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nPartos: Yeah, a king is a man that can rob people by law, and not by night like me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nPartos: My name is Partos, but you can call me Party.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>prison</b><br/>\nPartos: You mean that's a JAIL? They told me it's the finest hotel in town! THAT explains the lousy roomservice!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>tibia</b><br/>\nPartos: I love this world. I just wish I could see some other part of it now and then.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nPartos: Geee, someone stole my watch. Bad company down here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>city</b><br/>\nPartos: I love the city. I just wish I could see some other part of it now and then.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>djinns</b><br/>\nPartos: I won't talk about that.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Quentin\">Quentin</a></b><br/>\nPartos: By the gods, he visits us 'criminals' now and then to 'save' us. Who is going to save me from this boredom on two legs?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></b><br/>\nPartos: Yes, I've lived in Ankrahmun for quite some time. Ahh, good old times! ...<br/>\nPartos: Unfortunately I had to relocate. &lt;sigh&gt; ...<br/>\nPartos: Business reasons - you know.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>criminalists</b><br/>\nPartos: Bah, I did nothing serious. I just had a little fun. In Ankrahmun nobody would have cared about these kind of things...<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>noodles</b><br/>\nPartos: I bet one could get some fine ransom, if he dognappes this furball.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>party</b><br/>\nPartos: Yeah! Come in and let's have a party.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nPartos: Good bye, visit me again. I will be here, promised.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Partos</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["the-djinn-war-efreet-faction"],"pos":{"x":32323,"y":32280,"z":8}}